WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.404 --> 00:00:01.904
- ♫ We're Jewish, it's Christmas

00:00:01.904 --> 00:00:03.360
♫ There's no Yuletide cheer

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:04.689
♫ So bugger the eggnog

00:00:04.689 --> 00:00:06.594
♫ And (grunts) the reindeer ♫

00:00:06.594 --> 00:00:08.287
- That is not a Jewish thing.
- (laughs)

00:00:09.748 --> 00:00:12.103
Jews Decorate Christmas Trees

00:00:12.103 --> 00:00:14.496
- I've never touched a Christmas tree.

00:00:14.496 --> 00:00:17.445
I assume if I did, my hands
would burn or something.

00:00:17.445 --> 00:00:18.629
- It's just about glitter.

00:00:18.629 --> 00:00:19.581
- I think Christmas sucks.

00:00:19.581 --> 00:00:20.998
- I feel like I'll be pretty good at this.

00:00:20.998 --> 00:00:22.484
- Christmas sweater!

00:00:22.484 --> 00:00:23.714
- Let's see what we have here.

00:00:23.714 --> 00:00:25.595
- Why do they make Jesus a baby?

00:00:25.595 --> 00:00:27.861
- Anything with a hook on
it, let's put on the tree.

00:00:28.984 --> 00:00:30.605
- That was pretty good!

00:00:30.605 --> 00:00:31.481
Look at that, I just threw on--

00:00:31.481 --> 00:00:32.442
- No!

00:00:32.442 --> 00:00:34.144
- Oh wait, we could put eyes under it too.

00:00:34.144 --> 00:00:34.946
- Ok.

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:36.870
Oh, that's not so hard.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:39.081
- She has a nice little angel yarmulke.

00:00:40.676 --> 00:00:42.335
- Put my keys on there.

00:00:42.335 --> 00:00:43.232
- She needs a belt.

00:00:43.232 --> 00:00:44.207
- This tree looks delicious.

00:00:44.207 --> 00:00:45.670
- Smells great.

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:46.389
- (crunches teeth)

00:00:46.389 --> 00:00:48.200
- This tree looks super fake.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:49.570
- This is tacky.

00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:50.476
- Just because we're Jewish, we know

00:00:50.476 --> 00:00:51.962
what real trees are supposed to look like.

00:00:51.962 --> 00:00:54.725
- I guess candy canes are
good at hanging on trees,

00:00:54.725 --> 00:00:57.418
because they're definitely terrible candy.

00:00:57.418 --> 00:00:58.394
- I feel like if my family did this,

00:00:58.394 --> 00:00:59.949
we would just leave the tree up forever,

00:00:59.949 --> 00:01:01.668
because no one would want to clean it up.

00:01:01.668 --> 00:01:04.175
- Look at this skirt, it's
not even covering her knees.

00:01:04.175 --> 00:01:07.031
- Are pinecones, is that Christian?

00:01:07.031 --> 00:01:08.308
- Is this the Virgin Mary?

00:01:08.308 --> 00:01:09.933
- I don't know if the
Virgin Mary had wings.

00:01:09.933 --> 00:01:12.371
- My understanding is the
goys sing while they do this?

00:01:12.371 --> 00:01:15.088
- ♫ All I want for Christmas ♫

00:01:15.088 --> 00:01:17.503
- Oh could you name those seven reindeer?

00:01:17.503 --> 00:01:18.664
Galant!

00:01:18.664 --> 00:01:19.360
- Knoll.

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:20.428
- Like a grassy knoll.

00:01:20.428 --> 00:01:22.193
- Who is Noel?

00:01:22.193 --> 00:01:23.865
Is Noel God, is he Jesus?

00:01:23.865 --> 00:01:25.583
- Dancer...
- Dancer.

00:01:25.583 --> 00:01:26.883
- Lemony.
- Nope.

00:01:26.883 --> 00:01:29.089
- Can I just wrap parts
of it in aluminum foil?

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:31.527
- It's conspiracy theory tree.

00:01:31.527 --> 00:01:33.895
- They rhyme, a lot of them rhyme!

00:01:33.895 --> 00:01:36.078
Lancer, Prancer, Gandalf...

00:01:36.078 --> 00:01:37.216
- Yeah, you can put that on.

00:01:37.216 --> 00:01:38.353
If you want to go to Hell.

00:01:38.353 --> 00:01:40.930
- One, two, three!

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:42.021
Yay!

00:01:42.021 --> 00:01:43.020
- Merry Christmas!

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:44.506
- Merry Christmas!

00:01:44.506 --> 00:01:46.062
Those are definitely a fire hazard.

00:01:46.062 --> 00:01:47.710
- I feel like if a rabbi sees this,

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:49.382
they're gonna kick me out of Judaism.

00:01:49.382 --> 00:01:50.566
- I'm not a Jew anymore, right?

00:01:50.566 --> 00:01:51.541
- I think I killed it.

00:01:51.541 --> 00:01:53.329
- I don't know why everyone's
always making a big deal

00:01:53.329 --> 00:01:54.374
about decorating a Christmas tree.

00:01:54.374 --> 00:01:56.933
I feel like we did it pretty
quickly and totally kicked ass.

00:01:56.933 --> 00:01:59.111
Happy Holidays!

00:01:59.111 --> 00:01:59.909
- [Voiceover] How do you feel now

00:01:59.909 --> 00:02:02.103
that you've decorated a Christmas tree?

00:02:02.103 --> 00:02:04.057
- Like a whole new person.

00:02:04.057 --> 00:02:05.412
- I'd give it like a B.

00:02:05.412 --> 00:02:06.752
- We forgot one thing.

00:02:07.641 --> 00:02:08.738
Mistletoe.

00:02:08.738 --> 00:02:10.839
- Yeah, I'm reasonably
sure we got everything.

